  "title": {
    "rendered": "LymeFiber Billing Portal"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n\n<p>If you have not yet requested/received your login credentials please call our office at <a href=\"tell:833-795-5300\">(833)795-5300</a> or email <a href=\"mailto:Support@notices.lymefiber.net\">Support@notices.lymefiber.net</a> if you have any questions or concerns. Please follow the link below to access the LymeFiber Billing Portal!</p>\n<p><strong><a tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"https://account.lymefiber.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-stringify-link=\"https://acount.lymefiber.net\" data-sk=\"tooltip_parent\" data-remove-tab-index=\"true\">Billing Portal</a></strong></p>\n<p>For clear, easy-to understand, and accurate information about the cost, value, and features included in our fiber broadband products please see the <a href=\"https://www.lymefiber.net/internet-broadband-fact-labels/\">LymeFiber Broadband Facts labels</a>.</p>\n\n",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>If you have not yet requested/received your login credentials please call our office at (833)795-5300 or email Support@notices.lymefiber.net if you have any questions or concerns. Please follow the link below to access the LymeFiber Billing Portal! Billing Portal For clear, easy-to understand, and accurate information about the cost, value, and features included in our fiber broadband [&hellip;]</p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
